1
00:00:00,176 --> 00:00:02,136
(Leonard:)I'm not leaving here
without Penny's money.

2
00:00:03,679 --> 00:00:05,889
(Kurt:)What happened to your backup?

3
00:00:06,641 --> 00:00:08,561
(Leonard:)I don't need backup.

4
00:00:08,726 --> 00:00:10,186
(Leonard:)I have right on my side.

5
00:00:15,191 --> 00:00:18,281
(Leonard:)And I'm wearing cargo shorts
under my pants.

6
00:00:20,863 --> 00:00:22,363
(Sheldon:)Congratulations.

7
00:00:22,532 --> 00:00:24,612
(Sheldon:)You may not have succeeded
in getting cash...

8
00:00:24,784 --> 00:00:27,704
(Sheldon:)...but you did secure
a formal acknowledgment of the debt.

9
00:00:33,126 --> 00:00:36,466
(Howard:)Maybe we should have your head
notarized.

10
00:00:39,006 --> 00:00:41,966
(Raj:)If anybody cares, I still have to pee.

11
00:00:48,474 --> 00:00:49,974
(Leonard:)Hey.

12
00:00:51,519 --> 00:00:53,189
(Penny:)- Is Sheldon here?
- Yeah, hang on.

13
00:00:53,354 --> 00:00:54,394
(Leonard:)Sheldon.

14
00:00:54,564 --> 00:00:56,314
- Nice hat.
- You know?

15
00:00:56,482 --> 00:00:59,572
(Leonard:)It's kind of a fashionable look
these days.

